Vercel Web Analytics Installation and Configuration Report
==========================================================

SUMMARY:
--------
Vercel Web Analytics was already properly installed and configured in this Next.js project. No changes were necessary.

CURRENT CONFIGURATION:
----------------------

1. Package Installation:
   - @vercel/analytics v2.0.1 is installed in package.json
   - Package is listed in dependencies (not devDependencies)
   - Installation verified via npm install

2. Analytics Integration:
   - Location: app/layout.tsx (Next.js App Router root layout)
   - Implementation follows official Vercel documentation guidelines
   - Analytics component imported from '@vercel/analytics/next'
   - Component placed correctly at the end of <body> tag

3. Code Implementation (app/layout.tsx):
   ```typescript
   import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";
   
   export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
     return (
       <html lang="en" className="h-full antialiased">
         <body className="min-h-full flex flex-col">
           {children}
           <Analytics />
         </body>
       </html>
     );
   }
   ```

