DEPLOYMENT NOTES:
----------------
To enable Web Analytics tracking on Vercel:
1. Navigate to your Vercel project dashboard
2. Go to the Analytics tab
3. Click "Enable Web Analytics"
4. Deploy your application using: vercel deploy
5. After deployment, verify by checking browser Network tab for requests to /_vercel/insights/*

NO CHANGES REQUIRED:
-------------------
The project already has Vercel Web Analytics correctly installed and configured according to the latest official documentation. The implementation is production-ready and will begin tracking once enabled in the Vercel dashboard.
